                    'title' => 'Last stone weight',
                    'description' => 'You have n stones with the given weights. While at least two stones are left, take the two heaviest. If they weigh the same, both are destroyed. Otherwise the lighter one is destroyed, and the heavier one now weighs the difference and goes back with the others. Print the weight of the last stone, or 0 if no stone is left.

Input
Line 1: n, the number of stones.
Line 2: the n weights, separated by single spaces.

Output
One line with the weight of the last stone, or 0.

Constraints
1 <= n <= 2000
1 <= each weight <= 1000000000',
